        "original_id": "2012442e-ce6b-5b15-bcb2-1a32f17432c3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Air Lituanica, AirBaltic\n- Places: Vilnius, Lithuania\n- Products: Vilnius Airport, Riga International Airport, Tallinn Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Air Lituanica was a Lithuanian airline headquartered in Vilnius and based at Vilnius Airport.\n- Vilnius Airport is the international airport of Vilnius, the capital of Lithuania, and its codes are IATA VNO and ICAO EYVI.\n- AirBaltic has its main hub at Riga International Airport and additional bases at Tallinn Airport and Vilnius Airport.\n- Air Lituanica ceased operations in 2015.",
